From 9dbcab043d7b13617355599b11249259fa99d0c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:50:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Add checkpoint guide; point docs at the 2026-10-18 asset
 archives

docs/checkpoints.md describes all 59 trained heads (image group 3, multimodal 14, overfitting
diagnostic 42): where they come from, which one to use, the file format, the full list with
selected epoch and validation Macro-F1, usage and caveats. docs/checkpoints_manifest.csv and
docs/checkpoints_SHA256SUMS.txt list every file with its SHA-256.

docs/Multimodal_Assets.md now lists the four archives that replace the 2026-10-16 ones
(checkpoints, diagnostic checkpoints, feature caches, run outputs). All four unzip at the
repository root with `unzip -n`; their contents were checked to be byte-identical to the
earlier archives where those overlap. Every reference to the old archive names (README,
serving config and script, predictor error message, notebook, data README, API spec, test
results, team review) points at the new ones, and the image-group docs note that Zhihan's
kept head is byte-identical to the final reference head.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
